<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC29.026 A Girl's Best Friend</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Strickland, Robert W; USACF Newsletter, Mar 93, p15</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Crown suggestion Fred Van Sant n Diamond Dilemma Contest</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">This design won first place.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">68 facets + 16 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">2-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">L/W = 1.335  T/W = 0.331  U/W = 0.250</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374">P/W = 0.451 C/W = 0.184</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="392">Vol/W&#179; = 0.240</tspan>
